    /**
     * Suspend reseller.
     *
     * This function suspends a reseller account.
     *
     * Documented: Available in cPanel & WHM 11 and later, according to the pinned operation. Omitting reseller-only or
     * passing false suspends the reseller and all owned accounts; true suspends only the reseller. disallow defaults to
     * 0, allowing root or the owner to unsuspend; true restricts unsuspension to root. The source strongly recommends a
     * reason; this freeform reason is sensitive. The client performs no retry or rollback.
